# Frozen contracts are hash-pinned in docs/acceptance/gate_versions.md and
# asserted by tests/test_contract_pins.py, so their bytes must not depend on the
# platform that checked them out. Without this a Windows clone silently
# renormalises to CRLF and every pinned SHA-256 is wrong.
#
# Deliberately narrow. The benchmark profiles under eval/ are pinned too, but
# their recorded hashes were computed from CRLF bytes; normalising them here
# would rewrite a frozen benchmark to fix a problem it did not cause.
configs/gates/*.json text eol=lf
configs/aggregation/*.json text eol=lf
configs/aggregation/evaluators/*.json text eol=lf
